    ],
    impact: "The membership and package systems added roughly $52,000 per month in new revenue, with a meaningful portion now recurring and predictable. That is an additional $624,000 per year, built on patients the practice already had.",
    client: "Rebecca M., Multi-Provider Med Spa"
  },
  {
