    type: "High-Volume Aesthetics Practice",
    challengeIntro: "The owner assumed the next phase of growth meant more marketing spend. A full Revenue Leak Audit and patient journey review told a different story. The practice was busy, and the money was leaking on the way out the door.",
    challenge: [
      "Rebooking happening inconsistently at checkout",
